  "id": "pivotal-variable",
  "term": "pivotal variable",
  "definition": "In this mental health context, a pivotal variable is a key factor that strongly influences whether a person’s distress shifts from a lower to a higher state. In the source, coping self-efficacy is described as pivotal because changes in it were linked to when this non-linear change in distress occurred after wildfires.",
